---
// Support.astro — Support & manuals site banner
---

<section id="soporte" class="relative pt-6 pb-20 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background glow -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[300px] bg-primary/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="support-banner">
      <div class="support-glow"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start gap-5 text-center md:text-left">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 6.042A8.967 8.967 0 006 3.75c-1.052 0-2.062.18-3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 016 18c2.305 0 4.408.867 6 2.292m0-14.25a8.966 8.966 0 016-2.292c1.052 0 2.062.18 3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0018 18a8.967 8.967 0 00-6 2.292m0-14.25v14.25" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold text-xs mb-3">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M18.364 5.636l-3.536 3.536m0 5.656l3.536 3.536M5.636 5.636l3.536 3.536m0 5.656l-3.536 3.536M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
              Soporte 24/7
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-secondary mb-1">
              ¿Necesitas ayuda? <span class="text-primary">Centro de soporte y manuales</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-secondary/60 text-sm md:text-base max-w-lg">
              Consulta guías paso a paso, manuales de uso y soporte técnico para sacarle el máximo provecho a POS EXPRESS.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a
          href="https://posexpress.shop/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex-shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 text-white rounded-full font-bold text-base transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-lg shadow-primary/30 whitespace-nowrap"
        >
          Ir al centro de soporte
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"></path></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .support-banner {
    position: relative;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(17, 17, 17, 0.8);
    border: 1px solid rgba(242, 106, 33, 0.2);
    overflow: hidden;
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  }

  .support-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 300px;
    height: 100%;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center right, rgba(242, 106, 33, 0.12), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .support-banner {
      padding: 1.75rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
